---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<section
    class="canva-section chapter second-meeting"
    data-template-id="second-meeting-section"
    id="second-meeting"
    style="background:#1b2636"
>
    <div
        class="chapter-inner grid lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center"
    >
        <div>
            <p
                class="canva-text eyebrow mb-5"
                data-template-id="second-meeting-kicker"
                style="color: rgb(215, 184, 120); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
            >
                Another treasured memory
            </p>
            <h2
                class="canva-text chapter-title"
                data-template-id="second-meeting-title"
                style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;"
            >
                The IndiSetu Meeting
            </h2>
            <div class="fine-rule my-8"></div>
            <div
                class="canva-card quiet-card p-6 sm:p-8"
                data-template-id="second-meeting-detail-card"
                style="background: rgb(37, 46, 61);"
            >
                <p
                    class="canva-text serif"
                    data-template-id="second-meeting-location"
                    style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;"
                >
                    IndiSetu Kolkata Conference
                </p>
                <p
                    class="canva-text mt-3"
                    data-template-id="second-meeting-date"
                    style="color: rgb(215, 184, 120); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;"
                >
                    15th July 2026
                </p>
            </div>
            <p
                class="canva-text scribble body-copy mt-8 max-w-lg"
                data-template-id="second-meeting-caption"
                style="color: rgb(232, 197, 195); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;"
            >
                Another moment I&rsquo;m grateful we can hold close. Starting with the late sleepless nights we spent making the poster JUST right, with me being a perfectionist and you being the patient one, to the day of the conference itself, where we got to meet so many amazing people and learn not so much about anything, all the same basic AI and Neural Network shit. The best moments were the ones we spent in Eco Park with <i>Kaka</i> and Swastika. We having a full on photoshoot in the Japanese garden, to the fight we waged during lunch everything was just PERFECT.
            </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="lg:rotate-2">
            <div class="photo-frame rounded-2xl w-[100%] sm:w-[150%] sm:h-[520px]">
                <Image
                    inferSize={true}
                    alt="A selfie of us at the IndiSetu conference in Kolkata"
                    class="canva-image scale-100"
                    data-template-id="second-meeting-photo"
                    loading="lazy"
                    height={520}
                    width={780}
                    src="/images/indisetu.jpeg"
                />
            </div>
            <figcaption
                    class="canva-text mt-5 text-center"
                    data-template-id="indisetu-photo-one-caption"
                    style="color: rgb(196, 185, 182); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >
                    Just a stunning selfie.
                </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="flex justify-center mt-12">
            <a
                aria-label="Continue to ISCOMS"
                class="canva-link section-next"
                data-template-id="second-meeting-next"
                href="#iscoms"
                style="color: rgb(255, 244, 223); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >Next chapter &darr;</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
